# Upstream's net against the non-free data, kept and narrowed.
#
# The original sound and music are Bobby Prince's, are not redistributable
# and never enter this repository; see rule 2 of AGENTS.md. They are .wav
# and .hmi, so ignoring everything here except the free pack's Vorbis files
# still catches them, and scripts/check-licenses.sh fails on any file with
# no manifest entry.
/music
/sfx/*
!/sfx/*.ogg
!/sfx/CREDITS.md
